  "title": "The 1965 Ford Mustang America Fell in Love with Inducted into National Historic Vehicle Register - Hagerty",
  "summary": "TRAVERSE CITY, Mich., July 1, 2026 — The Hagerty Drivers Foundation, a 501(c)(3) non-profit dedicated to preserving automotive culture and history, today announced the induction of a 1965 Ford Mustang convertible as the 38th vehicle added to the National Historic Vehicle Register (NHVR). The announcement coincides with the opening of Ford Motor Company’s “Driving America Forward” exhibit […]",
